    <header>
        <h1>CAIO Executive Playbook & Sovereign AI Governance Architecture</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Authoritative C-Suite Framework for Enterprise AI Scale, Regulatory Risk Mitigation & Autonomous Revenue</p>
        <p><strong>Author:</strong> Miten Narendra Mehta | Chief AI Officer, Board Advisor, Ex-Google Cloud Leader</p>
    </header>

    <section>
        <h2>Executive Briefing Overview</h2>
        <p>This playbook provides Chief AI Officers (CAIO), Board Committees, and Enterprise Architects with a battle-tested blueprint to scale agentic AI systems while guaranteeing compliance with <strong>ISO 42001</strong>, <strong>EU AI Act</strong>, <strong>DORA</strong>, and <strong>NIST AI RMF</strong> frameworks.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>1. AI Governance & Risk Mitigation</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>ISO 42001 Compliance:</strong> Operationalizing AI Management Systems (AIMS) across enterprise business units.</li>
                <li><strong>EU AI Act Preparedness:</strong> Enforcing Article 13 (Explainability), Article 14 (Human Oversight), and Article 12 (Audit Trails).</li>
                <li><strong>Autonomous Decision Audit Trails:</strong> Sub-second logging of multi-agent interactions via FastMCP trust protocol.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>2. Commercial Scale & Ecosystem Monetization</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Hyperscaler Co-Sell:</strong> Architected $107M+ co-sell programs with Google Cloud and AWS.</li>
                <li><strong>ARR Acceleration:</strong> Scaled $15M+ influenced ARR partnerships at Tabhi AI.</li>
                <li><strong>Capital Advisory:</strong> Supported $760M+ in institutional capital formation, M&A, and 3 successful IPO exits.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section>
        <h2>3. Sovereign Agentic AI Architecture (237 OS Layers)</h2>
        <p>OrchestrAI OS represents the world's first FOSS federated control plane engineered for zero-trust security and sub-50ms edge inference:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Tier 5: Lean-4 Formal Verification & OPA Policy Engines</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Tier 4: Multi-Agent Swarms & ACE Protocols</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Tier 3: Sovereign Event Kernel & FastMCP Gateway</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Tier 2: Mem0 Memory-Augmented Generation (MAG) & PostgreSQL SSOT</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Tier 1: eBPF Tetragon Immune Kernel on k3d Kubernetes</strong></li>
        </ul>
    </section>

